# What the M9 demo must show, in order: a session's directory moves, the VM's
# never does, and a second shell on the same VM sees the same running world.
elixos-shim: pid 1, version
iex(1)> pwd()
"/priv/home"
iex(2)> cd("/tmp")
"/tmp"
iex(3)> pwd()
"/tmp"
iex(4)> File.cwd!()
"/"
iex(5)> Agent.start(fn -> 42 end, name: :shared)
iex(6)> Elixos.REPL.available()
[:erl, :iex]
iex(7)> User switch command (enter 'h' for help)
Eshell V
1> pwd().
"/priv/home"
2> file:get_cwd().
{ok,"/"}
3> 'Elixir.Agent':get(shared, fun(X) -> X end).
42
elixos-shim: shutdown poweroff
